## Basics

```javascript-norun
const name = "Ada";                 // cannot be reassigned
let count = 0;                      // can be reassigned
console.log(`${name} has ${count + 1} items`);
const n = Number("42"), s = String(42), b = Boolean("");   // conversions
```

| Operators | |
|---|---|
| `===` `!==` | Equal / not equal without conversion (never use `==`) |
| `&&` `\|\|` `!` | Logic, short-circuit; `\|\|` falls back on any falsy value |
| `??` | Falls back only on `null` / `undefined`: `volume ?? 50` |
| `a?.b`, `a?.[k]`, `f?.()` | Stop with `undefined` when `a` (or `f`) is nullish |
| `**`, `%` | Power, remainder |
| `cond ? a : b` | Conditional expression |

Falsy values: `false`, `0`, `""`, `null`, `undefined`, `NaN`. Everything else, including `[]` and `{}`, is truthy.

## Strings

| Code | Gives |
|---|---|
| `s.length`, `s[0]`, `s.at(-1)`, `s.slice(1, 4)` | Length, first, last, part |
| `s.toUpperCase()`, `s.trim()`, `s.padStart(5, "0")` | Case, trimmed, padded |
| `s.split(",")`, `parts.join(", ")` | Split, join |
| `s.includes(x)`, `s.startsWith(x)`, `s.indexOf(x)` | Tests, position (-1 if absent) |
| `s.replaceAll(a, b)`, `s.repeat(3)` | Replace every match, repeat |
| `n.toFixed(2)`, `parseInt("12px")`, `Number.isInteger(n)` | Format, parse, test numbers |

## Functions

```javascript-norun
function area(w, h = 1) { return w * h; }     // declaration, default parameter
const square = x => x * x;                     // arrow function
const sum = (...nums) => nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);   // rest parameter
Math.max(...values);                           // spread
const makeCounter = () => { let c = 0; return () => ++c; };  // closure
```

## Arrays

| Code | Gives |
|---|---|
| `a.push(x)`, `a.pop()`, `a.unshift(x)`, `a.shift()` | Add / remove at the end and start (changes `a`) |
| `a.map(f)`, `a.filter(f)`, `a.reduce(f, start)` | New array / new array / one value |
| `a.find(f)`, `a.findIndex(f)`, `a.some(f)`, `a.every(f)` | First match, its index, any, all |
| `a.includes(x)`, `a.indexOf(x)` | Membership, position |
| `a.slice(i, j)`, `a.splice(i, n, ...items)` | Copy part / remove and insert (changes `a`) |
| `[...a].sort((x, y) => x - y)`, `a.toSorted(f)` | Sorted copy; `sort` alone changes `a` and compares as strings |
| `a.flat()`, `a.flatMap(f)` | Flatten one level |
| `Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) => i)` | `[0, 1, ..., n-1]` |

